{"book":"I Chronicles","chapter":22,"entries":[{"id":10965,"title":"I Chronicles 22:1","segments":["¶Then David said, This [is] the house of the LORD God, and this [is] the altar of the burnt offering for Israel."],"ref":"I Chronicles 22:1","verse":1,"words":[{"text":"¶Then David","strong":"H1732"},{"text":" said","strong":"H559"},{"text":", This [is] the house","strong":"H1004"},{"text":" of the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" God","strong":"H430"},{"text":", and this [is] the altar","strong":"H4196"},{"text":" of the burnt offering","strong":"H5930"},{"text":" for Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":10966,"title":"I Chronicles 22:2","segments":["And David commanded to gather together the strangers that [were] in the land of Israel; and he set masons to hew wrought stones to build the house of God."],"ref":"I Chronicles 22:2","verse":2,"words":[{"text":"And David","strong":"H1732"},{"text":" commanded","strong":"H559"},{"text":" to gather together","strong":"H3664"},{"text":" the strangers","strong":"H1616"},{"text":" that [were] in the land","strong":"H776"},{"text":" of Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":"; and he set","strong":"H5975"},{"text":" masons","strong":"H2672"},{"text":" to hew","strong":"H2672"},{"text":" wrought","strong":"H1496"},{"text":" stones","strong":"H68"},{"text":" to build","strong":"H1129"},{"text":" the house","strong":"H1004"},{"text":" of God","strong":"H430"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":10967,"title":"I Chronicles 22:3","segments":["And David prepared iron in abundance for the nails for the doors of the gates, and for the joinings; and brass in abundance without weight;"],"ref":"I Chronicles 22:3","verse":3,"words":[{"text":"And David","strong":"H1732"},{"text":" prepared","strong":"H3559"},{"text":" iron","strong":"H1270"},{"text":" in abundance","strong":"H7230"},{"text":" for the nails","strong":"H4548"},{"text":" for the doors","strong":"H1817"},{"text":" of the gates","strong":"H8179"},{"text":", and for the joinings","strong